DATA LICENSES

The data snapshots in `data/snapshots/` are subject to the licenses of their
upstream sources. See `data/snapshots/manifest.json` for the per-dataset
citation, source URL, fetch date, and license. Headlines:

- ILO ILOSTAT, ILO Future of Work — ILO Open Data License
- World Bank WDI, Data360, Worldwide Bureaucracy Indicators — CC BY 4.0
- ESCO — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
- ITU Digital Development DataHub — ITU Open Data
- Wittgenstein Centre Human Capital Data Explorer — CC BY 4.0
- ISCO-08 — Public ILO standard
- Frey & Osborne (2017) — academic publication; values cited under fair use
